---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="AstroBranding — Posicionamiento Arquetípico & Malla Soberana Zerops">
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Navbar -->
    <nav class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-6 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-neutral-800/80">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20">
          Ω
        </div>
        <span class="font-extrabold text-lg tracking-tight">AstroBranding</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm font-medium">
        <a href="/docs" class="text-neutral-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">Docs</a>
        <a href="/gratis" class="text-neutral-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">Carta Gratis</a>
        <a href="/app" class="text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 transition-colors">Dossier</a>
        <a href="/desk" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded">/desk</a>
        <a href="/checkout" class="bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold shadow-md shadow-indigo-600/20 transition-all">
          Iniciar Funnel ($1+)
        </a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 pt-20 pb-28 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-950/60 border border-indigo-800/50 text-indigo-300 text-xs font-semibold mb-6">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-400 animate-ping"></span>
        Malla Soberana de 10 Servicios en Zerops Incus LXC
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight sm:leading-none">
        Decodificá tu Arquetipo.<br />
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 via-purple-300 to-rose-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          Monetizá tu Verdad Esencial.
        </span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-neutral-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Arquitectura de marca basada en la síntesis de 8 tradiciones astronómicas de alta precisión, orquestada sobre una infraestructura soberana de ultra-baja latencia en Bun, Astro 5 SSR y Hono.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="/gratis"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white text-neutral-950 font-bold text-sm hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-white/10"
        >
          Calcular Carta con Doble Opt-In
        </a>
        <a
          href="/checkout"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 text-neutral-200 font-bold text-sm hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-all"
        >
          Explorar Funnel Comercial (PWYW $1+)
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature Grid -->
      <section class="mt-28 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-left">
        <div class="bg-neutral-900/60 border border-neutral-800 p-6 rounded-2xl">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase text-indigo-400 block mb-2 font-semibold">01 / Fullstack Unificado</span>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-neutral-100 mb-2">Astro 5 SSR + Hono RPC</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            Un solo puerto 3000 en Bun. Páginas SSR con TTFB &lt;10ms, islas interactivas React 19 y endpoints REST con contratos Zod 4 compartidos.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-neutral-900/60 border border-neutral-800 p-6 rounded-2xl">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase text-emerald-400 block mb-2 font-semibold">02 / Doble Audiencia</span>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-neutral-100 mb-2">Dossier /app vs Cockpit /desk</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            Separación estricta de lenguajes: narrativa visual y ruedas SVG para el cliente; mapa de defensas y preguntas tácticas para el mentor.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-neutral-900/60 border border-neutral-800 p-6 rounded-2xl">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase text-amber-400 block mb-2 font-semibold">03 / Concurrencia & Outbox</span>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-neutral-100 mb-2">PostgreSQL 18 UUIDv7 + BullMQ</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            Patrón Outbox transaccional para eventos críticos y BullMQ sobre Valkey 7.2 con dashboard en <code class="text-neutral-300">/admin/queues</code>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
